{"title":"🎶 Niagara Falls Concert Road Trip: Roch Voisine at OLG Stage! $50 total","startsAt":"2026-11-13T16:30:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-13T23:30:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"# 🎶 Niagara Falls Concert Road Trip: Roch Voisine at OLG Stage!\n\n**Friday, November 13, 2026**\nReady for a night of great music and a little Niagara Falls adventure? Join us for a road trip from Toronto to see **Roch Voisine – The Lightfoot Sessions Live** at the **OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino**! 🎤🎶\n\n### 🎵 The Concert\n\nRoch Voisine brings **The Lightfoot Sessions Live** to Niagara Falls for a special evening celebrating his incredible career and the music of Canadian legend **Gordon Lightfoot**.\nVoisine is one of Canada's best-known singer-songwriters, with a career spanning four decades and 25 albums. His massive breakthrough came with *Hélène*, which went triple platinum in Canada and diamond in France.\nThe show will feature Roch's greatest hits along with his tribute to Gordon Lightfoot. 🇨🇦🎶\n**Concert:** Roch Voisine – The Lightfoot Sessions Live\n**Date:** Friday, November 13, 2026\n**Venue:** OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino\n**Showtime:** 8:00 PM\n👉 **Official show information:**\n[https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/roch-voisine.html](https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/roch-voisine.html)\n\n### 🚗 The Road Trip\n\nWe'll meet **outside Christie Station at 4:30 PM** and head to Niagara Falls in a **Kia Soul with SiriusXM radio**.\nDepending on traffic and how the evening is going, we may have some time to **sightsee around Niagara Falls before the concert**. 🌊📸\nAfter the show, we'll head back to Toronto.\n**Expected return to Toronto: around 11:30 PM**, depending on traffic and the timing of the evening.\n\n### 💰 COST: JUST $50\n\n**$50 includes:**\n\n* 🎟️ Your concert ticket\n* 🚗 Round-trip transportation from Toronto\n* ⛽ Transportation costs\n\nThat's it — **just $50 for the concert AND the ride!**\n\n### 📲 RESERVE YOUR SPOT\n\nSpots are **very limited** because we're travelling in a Kia Soul.\nTo reserve your spot, send **$50 by e-transfer to:**\nnicolasbello@yahoo.com\n\nYour spot is only locked in once the e-transfer has been received.\n\n### 🍁 Come for the concert. Stay for the road trip.\n\nLet's make a night of it — great music, Niagara Falls, SiriusXM on the drive, and a fun Meetup road trip with a small group!\n\n**Friday, November 13 • 4:30 PM departure • Christie Station**\n🎶 **Roch Voisine + Niagara Falls + Road Trip = Friday night plans!**","venue":{"name":"Christie Station Labyrinth","address":"Christie, 5 Christie St, Toronto, ON M6G 3B1, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.66399,"lng":-79.418724,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/6/9/1/highres_536358065.jpeg"}